[185.947459, "o", ") corresponds directly to test criteria.\"},\"novel\":{\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"explanation\":\"The task presents a custom synthetic forensic scenario combining plugin exploitation, web shell placement, cron jobs, and htaccess redirects.\"},\"agentic\":{\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"explanation\":\"Solving requires multi-step environment exploration across log files, web directories, cron jobs, and config files.\"},\"reviewable\":{\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"explanation\":\"The manifest.json file clearly defines expected artifacts and attack chain steps, making the task easy to audit.\"},\"instruction_concision\":{\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"explanation\":\"instruction.md is clear, concise, uses absolute paths, and avoids solution hints or unnecessary fluff.\"},\"solution_quality\":{\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"explanation\":\"solution/solve.sh correctly renders the complete reports needed to satisfy all verifier checks.\"},\"separate_verifier_configured\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"task.toml lacks environment_mode = \\\"container\\\", does not define an artifacts list, and tests/Dockerfile is missing.\"},\"environment_hygiene\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"Without separate verifier mode, test scripts and ground truth manifest.json are present in the agent container at start time.\"},\"structured_data_schema\":{\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"explanation\":\"Required report structures and citation formats are documented in instruction.md and findings.schema.json in /sas/handoff.\"},\"typos\":{\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"explanation\":\"No typos found in critical identifiers, filenames, paths, or commands.\"},\"difficulty_explanation_quality\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"The difficulty_explanation metadata field is missing from task.toml.\"},\"solution_explanation_quality\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"The solution_explanation metadata field is missing from task.toml.\"},\"verification_explanation_quality\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"The verification_explanation metadata field is missing from task.toml.\"},\"category_and_tags\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"The subcategory metadata field is missing from task.toml.\"},\"task_name\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"The task name dfir-eval/wordpress-defacement in task.toml contains a slash rather than being a single kebab-case folder slug.\"},\"resource_configuration\":{\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"explanation\":\"Timeouts and environment resource limits specified in task.toml are appropriate for the task.\"},\"task_readme\":{\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"explanation\":\"environment/README.md provides useful setup context without duplicating instructions.\"},\"expert_time_estimate\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"The expert_time_estimate_hours metadata field is missing from task.toml.\"},\"task_toml_schema\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"task.toml contains unrecognized field difficulty in [metadata] and missing standard metadata fields (difficulty_explanation, solution_explanation, verification_explanation, subcategory, expert_time_estimate_hours).\"},\"no_extraneous_files\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"The task folder contains unused directories assets/ (duplicate uncompressed disk files) and baselines/ (reference report benchmarks) not referenced by build, test, or solution scripts.\"},\"artifact_efficiency\":{\"outcome\":\"not_applicable\",\"explanation\":\"Separate verifier mode is not configured for this task.\"},\"verifier_execution_isolation\":{\"outcome\":\"not_applicable\",\"explanation\":\"The verifier parses static markdown reports and does not execute untrusted agent code.\"},\"ctrf_reporting\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"The verifier does not write CTRF test results to /logs/verifier/ctrf.json.\"},\"do_not_modify_enforced\":{\"outcome\":\"fail\",\"explanation\":\"instruction.md instructs the agent not to modify /disk, but the verifier does not test or verify whether /disk was altered